# Protein Gels And Western Blotting


@left


- 2. What are some different types of protein gels? What is western blotting? Compare them to nucleic acid gels from last week.


@top-right


![Instructor figure related to protein gels and western blotting](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_003.png)


@bottom-right


