# Considerations


@left


- Acrylamide is harder to make
  - so when looking at nucleic acids, use agarose
- You can purchase precast acrylamide gels with additional features
  - stacking gels
  - gradient gels


@right


![Instructor figure related to protein gels and western blotting](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_010.png)
