# Protein liquid chromatography


@left

- Gravity: no pump; very slow
- FPLC: larger volumes; medium pressure
- HPLC: medium volumes; high pressure
- UPLC: tiny volumes; very high pressure

@top-right


![Instructor figure related to protein purification chromatography](assets/lect04c-talking_points_set_3/image_036.png)


